text.en:
The three parities and the concatenation come straight from the statement.
```vhdl
p1 <= d(0) xor d(1) xor d(3);
p2 <= d(0) xor d(2) xor d(3);
p3 <= d(1) xor d(2) xor d(3);
code <= p1 & p2 & d(0) & p3 & d(1) & d(2) & d(3);
```

